config EXAMPLES_XIPC
	bool "xipc: ECoS cross-domain IPC ring (Jailhouse IVSHMEM)"
	default n
	---help---
		Minimal cross-domain publish/subscribe runtime between the root cell
		Linux and a NuttX inmate, carried over the Jailhouse IVSHMEM
		rw_section.

		Layout and ring operations live in ecos_xipc.h, shared byte-for-byte
		with the root side (kfusion/runtime/xshm/ecos_xipc.h). The deploy
		script copies it here; do not edit the copy.

		Requires the cell config to map the IVSHMEM rw_section
		(see crtos/jailhouse_overlay_pi4/configs/arm64/rpi4-nuttx.c).
